note native friendly: lists, loops, text, functions
define fizz of number as number giving text
if number modulo 15 is 0 then
give back the words FizzBuzz end words
otherwise if number modulo 3 is 0 then
give back the words Fizz end words
otherwise if number modulo 5 is 0 then
give back the words Buzz end words
end if
give back the words end words joined to number
end define
repeat 1 times do
say fizz of 15
say fizz of 9
say fizz of 10
say fizz of 7
end repeat
let scores be a list of 4 and 8 and 15
add 16 to scores
for each score in scores do
say the words score end words followed by score times 2
end for
say the words biggest end words followed by largest of scores followed by the words of end words followed by length of scores
